<!--
  The Depot crate, the same mark as web/public/favicon.svg: an amber
  outline, a seam across the top, and a block resting in the corner.

  That file is the reference for every copy of this mark — the favicon,
  the web nav, the Compose BrandMark and this launcher icon. They had
  drifted into four different shapes.

  Drawn at 108 with the key shape 56 across, centred — Android's keyline
  art for a 108 canvas, and comfortably clear of whatever mask a launcher
  applies to the outer 18 on each side.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">

